+# HANDOFF
+
+## Task Name
+Shared tokenizer shard-to-token conversion pipeline
+
+## Contracts Version Used
+Tokenizer runtime artifact contract from `shared_tokenizer.manifest.json`
+
+## Summary of Changes
+- Added a resumable C++ token conversion pipeline that reads deterministic text-shard order from `D:\CorpusShards`, encodes with the already-trained shared tokenizer, and writes `uint16` binary token files into `D:\ConvertedTokens\tokens`.
+- Added safe temp-to-final file promotion, durable progress tracking, ordered-file and per-file manifests, Markdown reporting, tokenizer identity/version/hash checks, and explicit unknown-token accounting.
+- Added `tokenizer_convert_tool.exe` plus dedicated conversion tests covering deterministic ordering, `uint16` output fidelity, stale partial cleanup, resume behavior, report generation, and tokenizer-version mismatch detection.
+- Updated tokenizer docs and README with exact build, run, resume, and inspection commands for the new converter.
+
+## Directories Changed
+- `include/tokenizer/`
+- `src/tokenizer/`
+- `tests/tokenizer/`
+- `docs/`
+- repo-root build configuration
+
+## Tests Run
+- `C:\Program Files\Microsoft Visual Studio\2022\Community\Common7\IDE\CommonExtensions\Microsoft\CMake\CMake\bin\cmake.exe -S C:\MINA\tokenizer -B C:\MINA\tokenizer\build -G "Visual Studio 17 2022" -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE="C:\Program Files\Microsoft Visual Studio\2022\Community\VC\vcpkg\scripts\buildsystems\vcpkg.cmake" -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH="C:\MINA\tokenizer\vcpkg_installed\x64-windows"`
+- `C:\Program Files\Microsoft Visual Studio\2022\Community\Common7\IDE\CommonExtensions\Microsoft\CMake\CMake\bin\cmake.exe --build C:\MINA\tokenizer\build --config Debug --target tokenizer_convert_tool token_conversion_tests`
+- `$env:PATH = "C:\MINA\tokenizer\build\Debug;C:\MINA\tokenizer\vcpkg_installed\x64-windows\debug\bin;C:\MINA\tokenizer\vcpkg_installed\x64-windows\bin;" + $env:PATH`
+- `C:\Program Files\Microsoft Visual Studio\2022\Community\Common7\IDE\CommonExtensions\Microsoft\CMake\CMake\bin\ctest.exe --test-dir C:\MINA\tokenizer\build -C Debug --output-on-failure -R "token_conversion_tests|tokenizer_tests"`
+
+## Known Limitations
+- The real `D:\CorpusShards` corpus is approximately `80.8 GB` across `303` text files. A full live conversion run does not finish inside one interactive coding turn, so completion of the full corpus still requires the long-running converter process to continue after handoff.
+- The converter checkpoints safely at file boundaries, not within a partially tokenized file. This is intentional and matches the requested resume semantics.
+- The current implementation emits durable file-completion progress and current-file state, but token totals remain committed only when a full source file completes.
+
+## Patch Confirmation
+- The corresponding patch file is plain-text unified diff.
+- The patch file is intended to be UTF-8 without BOM.
+- The patch file is non-binary.
+- The patch file is limited to this repo only.
